  "reviewBody": "The code check was straightforward. Only the toolboxes \"Statistics and Machine Learning\" and \"Image Processing\" needed to be added in contrast to what was stated in the README.\nAlso the preprint was not up-to-date with the code of the repository but the authors provided the current version upon request.\n",
